      "height": 105,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "target = 10.  sum = arr[L] + arr[R]\n\nsum > target  ->  R--   (chhota chahiye)\nsum < target  ->  L++   (bada chahiye)\n\nHar step ek possibility PERMANENTLY cut. O(n).",
